      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>When Treating Wounds, the therapeutic healer can treat up to four targets. If they succeed at a DC 20 check to Treat Wounds, they can also reduce the value of one Clumsy, Enfeebled, or Stupefied condition affecting a single patient by 1. They can reduce a Drained or Doomed condition instead if they succeed at a DC 30 check. This can't reduce permanent doomed conditions.</p>",
